Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
SystemRequirements: POSIX owner/mode semantics for the built-in server key
    store; Windows server deployments require an external HSM/KMS noise-root
    provider. The dsVertClient package remains cross-platform.
